{
  "id": "nitrogen_oxides__nox__emission_from_fuels",
  "title": "Nitrogen Oxides (NOx) Emission from Fuels",
  "description": "Emission of Nitrogen Oxides - NOx - with combustion of fuels like oil, coal, propane and more. NOx emissions contribute to eutrophication, acidification and the formation of ground-level ozone.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## NOx Emission from Fuels\n\nCalculate Nitrogen Oxides (NOx) emissions from fuel combustion. Note that emissions vary widely depending on application temperatures and air/fuel ratios.\n\n**Important Notes:**\n- Higher combustion temperatures increase NOx emissions\n- Higher air/fuel ratios increase NOx emissions\n- Hydrogen produces zero theoretical emissions, but in practice produces more NOx than natural gas due to high flame temperature\n- Catalytic systems on modern vehicles reduce NOx emissions"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "fuel_type",
          "label": "Fuel Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Oil",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "label": "Kerosene",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "label": "Coal",
              "value": 4.5
            },
            {
              "label": "Propane",
              "value": 2.3
            },
            {
              "label": "Gasoline",
              "value": 27
            },
            {
              "label": "Hydrogen",
              "value": 0
            },
            {
              "label": "Natural Gas",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "label": "Butane",
              "value": 2.3
            },
            {
              "label": "Wood, Birch 20% moisture content",
              "value": 0.7
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fuel_mass",
          "label": "Fuel Mass",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "nox_emission",
          "label": "NOx Emission",
          "formula": "inputs.fuel_type * inputs.fuel_mass",
          "unit": "10^-3 kg NOx",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "nox_emission_g",
          "label": "NOx Emission",
          "formula": "inputs.fuel_type * inputs.fuel_mass * 1000",
          "unit": "mg NOx",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
